{"blocks":[{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/11/9137849/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Hello"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/11/9137849/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/11/9137849/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"PARCO劇場の公演では沢山成長させて頂きました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/11/9137849/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがとうございました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"結果は残念だったけど、自分の大きな糧になりました！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/11/9137849/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これをバネにして、大きく一歩ずつ前に進みます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/11/9137849/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私は、少し悔いがあります！\nやっぱり２幕に立ちたかった！\n立って、見てもらいたかった！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも、今の自分が今の精一杯の努力、実力でした。\n１幕で出しきりました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まだまだ成長していきたいです！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/11/9137849/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"また今度、皆さんに見ていただくきかいがあるなら、\n皆さんにちゃんと恩返しがしたい！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"心配してくださった方！\nほんとーにありがとう！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私は、ポジティブでいたいので前を向いてます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/11/9137849/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"！えへへー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/11/9137849/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"コメントにもありましたが、皆応援してくださって、ちゃんと見てくれてて、凄く幸せで、嬉しいです、\n前回もその前も、沢山のコメントでなんかビックリしちゃった"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/11/9137849/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんないいことばっかりかいてくれてて..."},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/11/9137849/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アドバイスや励まし.........涙"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/11/9137849/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"客席には、私へ、メッセージをくださる方！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/11/9137849/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして、名前入りの団扇やお面！\nお面は始めてみました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/11/9137849/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あはは"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/11/9137849/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"嬉しかったでーす"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/11/9137849/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"3．3．7拍子では手をたたいてくださってThank Youです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/11/9137849/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ほんとーにビックリしました！涙"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして、これないけど応援してくださってた皆様...\n皆様がいてくれたから、勇気とパワーが湧いて来ました。"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/11/9137849/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当にありがとうございました\nどんなに心強かったか"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/11/9137849/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"感謝の気持ちでいっぱいです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/11/9137849/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/11/9137849/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これからも、初心を忘れず向上心でがんばりまぁやー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/11/9137849/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/11/9137849/0011.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まいやん＋まあや=まあやん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ハイ！黙ります"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/11/9137849/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まいやんの第一印象は綺麗なおねぇちゃんだなぁー！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/11/9137849/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"です！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも中身はヤバイ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/11/9137849/0012.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お笑いの人"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/11/9137849/0012.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/11/9137849/0012.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/11/9137849/0012.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"って感じかなぁー\nまいやんは本気でお笑い芸人になろうと思ってたらしいです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/11/9137849/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アメイジング事件発生"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/11/9137849/0013.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"外見だけじゃなく、中身も素敵なお姉ちゃんです!!"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/11/9137849/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/11/9137849/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まいやんはいつもオシリばっかり触ってくる！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/11/9137849/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ユッタンの影響かしらぁー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/11/9137849/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でもユッタンはオシリ触らない！\nって宣言してましたねっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/11/9137849/0013.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつまでつづくのかなぁー！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/11/9137849/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"わはは"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/11/9137849/0014.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/11/9137849/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/11/9137849/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"BYE"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/11/9137849/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/11/9137849/0010.gif","alt":""}],"source":"archive"}